Lefty says:
> >  I wouldn't exactly call CAP's conclusions positively received.
> 
> Certainly they were more positively received than Gott's.
> 
> I simply wonder whether there might be a small tendency here to be somewhat
> less critical of conclusions which we happen to enjoy than of those we
